{
"duration": 113.37158333333333,
"lines": [
{
"i": 0,
"id": "l1",
"text": "You're home alone. Your parents went out for dinner. They won't be back until midnight.",
"start": 3.4,
"end": 7.805
},
{
"i": 1,
"id": "l2",
"text": "You head down the hallway to grab a snack... past the family photos.",
"start": 8.205,
"end": 11.934
},
{
"i": 2,
"id": "l2b",
"text": "Like you do every single day.",
"start": 12.084,
"end": 13.642
},
{
"i": 3,
"id": "l3",
"text": "But tonight... something feels wrong.",
"start": 14.092,
"end": 15.838
},
{
"i": 4,
"id": "l4",
"text": "The beach photo from last summer. You, Mom, Dad...",
"start": 16.488,
"end": 19.247
},
{
"i": 5,
"id": "l4b",
"text": "and way back, by the water... someone is standing there.",
"start": 19.447,
"end": 22.407
},
{
"i": 6,
"id": "l5",
"text": "Tall. Way too thin. Its arms hang all the way down to its knees.",
"start": 22.907,
"end": 26.84
},
{
"i": 7,
"id": "l6",
"text": "You've walked past this picture a thousand times. It was never there.",
"start": 27.24,
"end": 30.936
},
{
"i": 8,
"id": "l7",
"text": "Next photo. Christmas. The living room.",
"start": 31.486,
"end": 33.547
},
{
"i": 9,
"id": "l7b",
"text": "There it is again. In the corner. Closer. Its head tilted... like it's listening.",
"start": 34.097,
"end": 38.579
},
{
"i": 10,
"id": "l8",
"text": "Your last birthday. It's standing right behind your chair...",
"start": 39.079,
"end": 42.023
},
{
"i": 11,
"id": "l8b",
"text": "its long grey fingers resting on your shoulder.",
"start": 42.523,
"end": 45.049
},
{
"i": 12,
"id": "l9",
"text": "And the last photo on the wall... you've never seen it before.",
"start": 45.699,
"end": 48.856
},
{
"i": 13,
"id": "l10",
"text": "It's this hallway. Tonight. You, from behind... staring at the photos.",
"start": 49.206,
"end": 53.076
},
{
"i": 14,
"id": "l11",
"text": "And it's not in this one.",
"start": 54.076,
"end": 55.332
},
{
"i": 15,
"id": "l12",
"text": "You stare at the empty picture... and in the glass of the frame... you see a reflection.",
"start": 55.932,
"end": 60.601
},
{
"i": 16,
"id": "l13",
"text": "Of the ceiling. Right above you.",
"start": 61.051,
"end": 62.617
},
{
"i": 17,
"id": "l14",
"text": "Don't look up.",
"start": 63.317,
"end": 64.208
},
{
"i": 18,
"id": "l15",
"text": "It's hanging there. Upside down.",
"start": 65.808,
"end": 67.47
},
{
"i": 19,
"id": "l15b",
"text": "Its grey skin sagging off its bones like a wet sheet. Its neck bent all the way back.",
"start": 67.82,
"end": 73.326
},
{
"i": 20,
"id": "l15c",
"text": "Its jaw hanging open... and something drips onto the floor next to you.",
"start": 73.576,
"end": 77.541
},
{
"i": 21,
"id": "l16",
"text": "Its pitch-black eyes don't blink. Its fingers twitch... one joint at a time.",
"start": 78.191,
"end": 82.906
},
{
"i": 22,
"id": "l17",
"text": "It only moves when you can't see it. And your phone battery... is at one percent.",
"start": 83.456,
"end": 87.866
},
{
"i": 23,
"id": "l18",
"text": "You have two options.",
"start": 88.416,
"end": 89.553
},
{
"i": 24,
"id": "l19",
"text": "Run for the front door. Ten steps through the dark hallway... right underneath it.",
"start": 89.803,
"end": 93.985
},
{
"i": 25,
"id": "l20",
"text": "Or lock yourself in the bathroom right next to you. The light works in there... but your parents won't be home for two more hours.",
"start": 94.335,
"end": 101.418
},
{
"i": 26,
"id": "l21",
"text": "What do you do? Front door, or bathroom? Tell me in the comments.",
"start": 101.968,
"end": 105.16
},
{
"i": 27,
"id": "l22",
"text": "And did you spot it in the very first second? Watch again.",
"start": 105.51,
"end": 108.53
},
{
"i": 28,
"id": "l23",
"text": "Follow... before it shows up in your photos too.",
"start": 108.78,
"end": 111.172
}
],
